IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cla2-common`
IMPORT `cla2-care`

-- Civil Liability Act 2002 (WA) -- baseline-2026-11: cases for s 13A and Part 2 Division 4 (cla2-care.l4).
-- Edges: each place in the CISS against each period; the s 3A items that take Division 3 or 4 away; the s 6(4) start date.
-- Expected values are worked by hand from the deposited text. The facts are illustrative.
-- BASELINE. Not for public use as advice.

§ `Cases -- care needs in the CISS, and structured settlements`

§§ `Short names`

`no class` MEANS `none of the s 3A classes`
`CTP` MEANS `item 2: damages the Motor Vehicle (Third Party Insurance) Act 1943 applies to`
`against my employer` MEANS `item 3: a claim against my employer under Part 7 Division 2 of the Workers Compensation and Injury Management Act 2023`
`intentional` MEANS `item 1: an unlawful act intended to cause personal injury, a sexual offence or other unlawful sexual conduct`
`tobacco` MEANS `item 4: smoking or other use of tobacco products`
`air` MEANS `item 5: damages under the Civil Aviation (Carriers' Liability) Act 1961`
`dust` MEANS `item 6: inhaling asbestos or silica, and no other item`

`lifetime` MEANS `I am a lifetime participant for this injury`
`interim` MEANS `I am an interim participant for this injury`
`ceased interim` MEANS `I was an interim participant, stopped being one, and did not become a lifetime participant`
`never` MEANS `I have never been a participant for this injury`
`while` MEANS `while I am, or was, a participant`
`future` MEANS `in the future: they will or may arise`
`before` MEANS `before I became a participant`

§§ `s 13A -- care needs in the CISS`

-- Arguments: my injury; my place in the CISS; when the needs arise; s 3A class; after Part 2 commenced.
`care` MEANS `Can I be awarded damages for my care needs in the CISS`

-- A workplace injury claimed against a third party (not the employer): s 13A bites.
#ASSERT `care` `a workplace injury` `lifetime` `while` `no class` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `care` `a workplace injury` `lifetime` `future` `no class` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `care` `a workplace injury` `lifetime` `before` `no class` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 13A(6): an interim participant is treated as a future lifetime participant.
#ASSERT `care` `a motor vehicle injury` `interim` `future` `no class` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `care` `a motor vehicle injury` `interim` `while` `no class` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 13A(7), (8): left the scheme as an interim participant: barred only for the interim period.
#ASSERT `care` `a motor vehicle injury` `ceased interim` `while` `no class` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `care` `a motor vehicle injury` `ceased interim` `future` `no class` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `care` `a motor vehicle injury` `ceased interim` `before` `no class` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `care` `a motor vehicle injury` `never` `while` `no class` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not a motor vehicle or workplace injury.
#ASSERT `care` `another injury` `lifetime` `while` `no class` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 3A takes Division 3 away: a CTP claim, a claim against the employer (baseline-2026-10 finding 3).
#ASSERT `care` `a motor vehicle injury` `lifetime` `while` `CTP` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `care` `a workplace injury` `lifetime` `future` `against my employer` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `care` `a workplace injury` `lifetime` `future` `dust` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 6(4).
#ASSERT `care` `a workplace injury` `lifetime` `while` `no class` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `ss 14, 15 -- structured settlements`

-- Arguments: agreed periodic payments; applied to the court; s 3A class; after Part 2 commenced.
`structured` MEANS `Can the court approve my structured settlement`

#ASSERT `structured` TRUE TRUE `no class` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `structured` TRUE FALSE `no class` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `structured` FALSE TRUE `no class` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `structured` TRUE TRUE `no class` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Division 4 kept for items 2, 3, 4 and 6, with no s 6(4) start date.
#ASSERT `structured` TRUE TRUE `CTP` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `structured` TRUE TRUE `CTP` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `structured` TRUE TRUE `against my employer` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `structured` TRUE TRUE `tobacco` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `structured` TRUE TRUE `dust` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Taken away for items 1 and 5.
#ASSERT `structured` TRUE TRUE `intentional` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `structured` TRUE TRUE `air` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
